erican " [:a {:href "/athletes/147316"} "Chris Nilsen"] " was the only other vaulter over 5.92, which earned him the silver medal. He went on to clear a PR 5.97 but missed his three attempts at 6.02. Defending gold medalist " [:a {:href "/athletes/132777"} "Thiago Braz"] " (BRA) won the bronze medal as the only other vaulter to clear 5.87."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Qualifying"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3563"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/146747"} "Mondo Duplantis"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "5.75 (=3)"] [:td {} "6.02 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3957"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/147316"} "Chris Nilsen"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "5.75 (=1)"] [:td {} "5.97 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "1308"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/132777"} "Thiago Braz"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BRA.png"}] "BRA"]] [:td {} "5.75 (=8)"] [:td {} "5.87 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2223"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/143515"} "Emmanouil Karalis"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GRE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :s